---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Honorific from '../components/Honorific.astro';
import HowItWorks from '../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import '../styles/app.css';
import data from '../data/content.json';
const eras=[...new Set(data.events.map(event=>event.era))];
const topics=[...new Set(data.events.map(event=>event.topic))];
---
<Shell title="Seerah Timeline">
  <script is:inline>document.body.setAttribute('data-projector','')</script>
  <section class="intro"><span class="motif" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="intro-top"><span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>{data.events.length} events</span></div> <h1>{learning.heading}</h1> <p>Sourced events from the Prophet's life <Honorific />, with approximate dates.</p></section>
  <section class="panel daily no-print" id="daily" aria-label="Which came first? Daily and Practice" hidden><div class="daily-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Mode"><button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-daily" aria-controls="daily-panel" aria-selected="true">Daily</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-practice" aria-controls="daily-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Practice</button></div><div class="panel-body" id="daily-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-daily"></div></section>
  <noscript><p class="micro">The daily pair needs JavaScript. <a href="/challenge/">Try the four-event challenge</a> instead.</p></noscript>
  <p class="date-link no-print"><a href="/challenge/">Which came first? Put four events in order <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  <section class="panel panel-body bottom-gap no-print"><div class="filters"><label class="field search-field">Search<input id="timeline-search" type="search" placeholder="Search Hira, migration, a person…"/></label> <label class="field">Period<select id="era-filter"><option value="all">All periods</option>{eras.map(era=><option value={era}>{era}</option>)}</select></label> <label class="field">Topic<select id="topic-filter"><option value="all">All topics</option>{topics.map(topic=><option value={topic}>{topic}</option>)}</select></label></div> <div class="spread top-gap"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="bookmarks-only"/>Show bookmarked events</label> <span class="count-label" id="event-count" role="status">{data.events.length} events</span></div></section>
  <div class="chronology-layout"><div id="timeline-list" class="chronology">{eras.map(era=><section class="era-group" data-era-group={era}><h2 class="era-heading">{era}</h2><div class="era-events">{data.events.filter(event=>event.era===era).map(event=><article class="timeline-entry" data-event={event.id} data-era={event.era} data-topic={event.topic} data-search={`${event.title} ${event.summary} ${event.place} ${event.topic}`.toLowerCase()}><div class="timeline-date">{event.date}</div><a class="timeline-event-link" href={`/event/${event.id}/`} data-select={event.id}><span class="event-title">{event.title}</span> <span class="event-place">{event.place} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a><p>{event.summary}</p><span class="pill neutral">{event.topic}</span></article>)}</div></section>)}</div>{' '}<aside class="event-aside" aria-label="How this works and the selected event"><HowItWorks><p>Follow the prophetic mission through {data.events.length} sourced events. Read the reports, compare events in order, and see where the dates are uncertain.</p><p><strong>Daily.</strong> Each day has one pair of events: pick the one that came first, then read the sources and date notes. The puzzle number (#N) changes at your local midnight, so two people in different time zones can be on different numbers. Practice is always available and unlimited.</p><p><strong>Stored on this device.</strong> The key <code>seerah-timeline:daily</code> holds today's number and your result. If you tick "Keep a streak on this device", <code>seerah-timeline:streak</code> holds your last day, count and best. Nothing leaves your browser, and each value expires after 30 days.</p><p>All event pages and sources work without JavaScript. JavaScript adds filters, the detail panel, and optional bookmarks.</p><p><strong>Dates need context.</strong> CE and AH labels are approximate navigation aids. Sources may establish an event without fixing its exact date. Event notes preserve those distinctions and debated placements.</p></HowItWorks><div id="selected-event" role="region" aria-label="Selected timeline event" tabindex="-1"><div class="panel panel-body"><p>Select an event to read its report.</p></div></div></aside></div>{' '}
  <div class="empty panel" id="timeline-empty" hidden><h2>Nothing matches</h2><p>Try a different word, or show the full chronology.</p><button class="button secondary" id="reset-filters">Show all events</button></div>{' '}
</Shell>
<script>import '../lib/timeline';import '../lib/daily-app';</script>
<style is:global>
 .chronology-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 400px;gap:34px;align-items:start}.event-aside{min-width:0}.era-heading{font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-ink);margin:28px 0 19px}.era-group:first-child .era-heading{margin-top:3px}.era-events{border-left:1px solid var(--line);margin-left:6px;padding-left:25px}.timeline-entry{position:relative;padding:0 0 26px}.timeline-entry::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:-31px;top:5px;width:10px;height:10px;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg)}.timeline-entry.active::before{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px var(--tint)}.timeline-date{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:9px;letter-spacing:.015em}.timeline-event-link{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5}.timeline-event-link:hover .event-title,.timeline-entry.active .event-title{color:var(--accent-ink)}.event-title{font-size:1rem;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.02em}.event-place{color:var(--muted);font-size:.67rem;white-space:nowrap;margin-top:4px}.timeline-entry>p{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin:10px 0 12px}.timeline-entry.active{padding:17px;margin:-17px -17px 9px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px}.timeline-entry.active::before{left:-15px;top:23px}.event-detail-title{font-family:Newsreader,Georgia,serif;font-size:2rem;font-weight:450;line-height:1.25;margin:14px 0 17px}.event-detail-summary{font-size:.91rem;line-height:1.85}.event-aside .source-list li{padding:12px 14px}.event-aside .source-list a{font-size:.78rem}.date-note{font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);padding-left:14px;border-left:2px solid var(--line);margin:20px 0}.event-detail-meta{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.event-number{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--muted)}.event-aside .actions .button{font-size:.74rem;padding:10px 12px}.event-detail-links{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}.event-detail-links button{max-width:48%;font-size:.73rem}.event-aside details summary{font-size:.78rem;cursor:pointer}.event-aside .source-quote{font-size:.78rem}@media(max-width:960px){.chronology-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 340px;gap:24px}.event-place{display:none}}@media(max-width:760px){.chronology-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.event-aside{position:static}.event-aside .panel-body{padding:23px}.event-detail-title{font-size:1.8rem}.chronology{padding-top:6px}.era-events{padding-left:20px}.timeline-entry::before{left:-26px}.timeline-entry.active::before{left:-10px}}@media print{.chronology-layout{display:block}.event-aside{position:static}.chronology{display:none}.event-aside .no-print{display:none!important}}
</style>
